<<set $anaTalkedTo to true>>
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The woman before you is decked out in studded leather garments and steel-toed cleats. Her long black hair is kept out of her face with a red headband crowned in metallic silver.][/nomarkup]
{$bartender}: Ma'am, for the last time, we're not going tochange the playlist. Management picks the set. 
{$anastasia}: You're killing me. Tories call this shit, hard rock? Feels like I'm back in church.  
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][She speaks with a thick Eastern European accent.][/nomarkup]
{$bartender}: Look, people come here to dance, not to mosh. 
{$anastasia}: C'mon, you know you can play something harder than this.
{$anastasia}: [nomarkup][Scoffs.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The bartender locks eyes with you, silently pleading for help.][/nomarkup]
-> {$pcName}: I agree. This music sucks.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The punk turns her attention towards you now, half-grinning, half-sneering.][/nomarkup]
{$anastasia}: You hear it too!? All style, no soul. It's hair spray and boys whining. 
{$bartender}: It's what people like, okay? People don't like screaming over their cocktails.
{$anastasia}: [nomarkup][Screaming][/nomarkup] HAVE THEY EVER TRIED!
