title: anaIsSire
---
-> {$pcName}: Are you my Sire? #line:08ada90 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The notion catches her by surprise.][/nomarkup]
{$anastasia}: Look I may play fast and loose with the Camarilla's rules more than most, but even I am smart enough to not run around embracing illegitimate childe.
{$anastasia}: Besides, I can tell you're not a Lasombra just by looking at you so that acquits me. 
{$kieran}: You're a Lasombra? Bold of you to announce yourself so, Sabbat spy! You're coming with us!
{$anastasia}: My clan alone makes me no more Sabbat than you are, bigot. I am trying to be straightforward with you.
-> {$pcName}: Lasombra?
{$kieran}: A bloodline of shadowcasters. Known to make up the ranks of the Sabbat.
{$anastasia}: And here I came to Vegas hoping it would live up to the promises your Prince pretends to espouse about equality. Don't we have a spokesperson on the Primogen Council?
{$kieran}: A Lasombra who works with the Camarilla is one thing, but one who does not so much as announce herself in another's vampire's domain proves other intentions.
-> {$pcName}: You're coming with us. #line:01f183c 
    <<RecruitAnastasia>>
    {$anastasia}:{$anastasia}: Let's get this over with.
    ->[nomarkup][End conversation.][/nomarkup]
-> {$pcName}: Kieran, let's go. #line:06c93f1 
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Kieran rubs his temple exasperatedly.][/nomarkup] #line:0e5b9b2
    {$anastasia}: Thank you.
    ->[nomarkup][End conversation.][/nomarkup]
